DERIVATION
This work is a companion to, and derives from, GottFA80 by Ralf Zerres
("bontango") — https://github.com/bontango/GottFA80 — which is GPL-3. The FPGA
side lives in a separate tree; this repository holds the ESP32-S3 firmware and
its web UI.

